---
title: "Work — Nocturea"
description: "Five projects: a studio site, a desktop reading app, a scientific-news aggregator, a mark with its guidelines and a festival site."
active: work
---
<section class="noc-wrap noc-section--hero">
  <p class="noc-eyebrow noc-eyebrow--head">Work</p>
  <h1 class="noc-h1">Five projects, each one started on a blank page.</h1>
  <p class="noc-lead noc-hero-lead">Websites, apps and identities — designed and built end to end. Hover a row to see the work; open it to read why it looks the way it does.</p>
</section>

<section class="noc-wrap noc-work">
  <div class="noc-work-list">
    {{- for project of projects }}
    <a href="{{ project.url }}" class="noc-work-row">
      <span class="noc-work-row__num">{{ project.num }}</span>
      <span>
        <span class="noc-work-row__name">{{ project.name }}</span>
        <span class="noc-work-row__line">{{ project.kind }} — {{ project.client }}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="noc-work-row__year">{{ project.year }}</span>
    </a>
    {{- /for }}
  </div>

  <aside class="noc-work-aside" aria-hidden="true">
    {{- for project of projects }}
    <div class="noc-work-preview">
      {{# Every preview is framed, whatever the project's `framed` setting —
          that flag governs the case study, where a photograph must not be
          dressed as a screenshot. Here the frame is the component: dropping
          it for one project shortens that preview by the height of the title
          bar and pulls its caption 27px out of line with the rest.
          --stage-bg mattes a contained shot in the project's own colour. #}}
      <div class="noc-frame noc-frame--soft" style="--stage-bg:{{ project.stage.bg }}">
        <div class="noc-frame__bar">
          <span class="noc-frame__dot"></span>
          <span class="noc-frame__dot"></span>
          <span class="noc-frame__dot"></span>
        </div>
        <img src="{{ project.image.src }}" width="{{ project.image.w }}" height="{{ project.image.h }}"
             alt="" loading="lazy" style="--shot-pos:{{ project.image.position }}"
             class="noc-preview-img noc-preview-img--{{ project.image.fit }}" />
      </div>
      <p class="noc-work-preview__name">{{ project.name }}</p>
      <p class="noc-body">{{ project.summary }}</p>
    </div>
    {{- /for }}
  </aside>
</section>
